# T4 · 종료 때 세션(dir2 session.cfg 형식)이 격리 홈에 남는다 · 창 기하 저장.
id: session-save
title: 종료 = session.conf · settings.conf(window.*) 저장
tree: dir sub
tree: file a.txt 1
settings: ui.lang=en
cmd: @ready:file.new_tab
cmd: @ready:nav:<root>/sub
cmd: @ready:view.mode_flat
cmd: @ready:panel:1
cmd: @ready:quit
check: <home>/session.conf: # nexa-dir session v1
check: <home>/session.conf: active_panel=1
check: <home>/session.conf: panel0.tabs=<root>|<root>
check: <home>/session.conf: panel0.active=1
check: <home>/session.conf: panel0.modes=tree|flat
check: <home>/settings.conf: window.main_size=
check: <home>/settings.conf: ui.lang=en
